[00:00.00] 作词 : 染谷和美
[00:01.00] 作曲 : 植松伸夫
[00:02.00] 编曲 : 浜口史郎
[00:35.54]Whenever sang my songs
[00:40.77]On the stage , on my own
[00:45.87]Whenever said my words
[00:51.24]Wishing they would be heard
[00:56.38]I saw you smiling at me
[01:01.23]Was it real or just my fantasy
[01:06.96]You’d always be there in the corner
[01:11.94]Of this tiny little bar
[01:18.16]My last night here for you
[01:23.54]same old songs , just once more
[01:28.33]My last night here with you ?
[01:33.75]Maybe yes , maybe no
[01:38.73]I kind of liked it your way
[01:43.75]How you shyly placed your eyes on me
[01:49.04]Oh , did you ever know ?
[01:53.88]That I had mine on you
[02:01.19]Darling , so there you are
[02:05.92]With that look on your face
[02:11.75]As if you’re never hurt
[02:16.29]As if you’re never down
[02:21.02]Shall I be the one for you
[02:25.96]Who pinches you softly but sure
[02:32.09]If frown is shown then
[02:34.58]I will know that you are no dreamer
[03:06.89]So let me come to you
[03:11.93]Close as I wanted to be
[03:16.95]Close enough for me
[03:21.88]To feel your heart beating fast
[03:26.77]And stay there as I whisper
[03:31.30]How I love your peaceful eyes on me
[03:36.89]Did you ever know
[03:41.19]That I had mine on you
[03:48.24]Darling , so share with me
[03:52.62]Your love if you have enough
[03:57.41]Your tears if you're holding back
[04:01.94]Or pain if that’s what it is
[04:07.07]How can I let you know
[04:11.80]I’m more than the dress and the voice
[04:17.74]Just reach me out then
[04:20.20]You will know that you’re not dreaming
[04:27.03]Darling , so there you are
[04:31.61]With that look on your face
[04:36.76]As if you’re never hurt
[04:40.96]As if you’re never down
[04:45.79]Shall I be the one for you
[04:50.28]Who pinches you softly but sure
[04:56.25]If frown is shown then
[04:58.45]I will know that you are no dreamer
